{"seq":3,"slug":"order-fulfillment","title":"订单履约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-logistics/warehouse-and-fulfillment/order-fulfillment","wordCount":1043,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"订单履约\">订单履约</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>订单履约（Order Fulfillment）是将消费者的在线订单转化为实体包裹并交付的端到端过程。履约能力决定了电商平台的服务承诺——能否做到&quot;次日达&quot;、&quot;当日达&quot;甚至&quot;小时达&quot;。履约策略的核心是在时效、成本和复杂度三者之间做出最优权衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[订单接收] --&gt; B[订单校验]&#10;    B --&gt; C[库存分配]&#10;    C --&gt; D[仓库选择]&#10;    D --&gt; E[拆单/合单]&#10;    E --&gt; F[波次规划]&#10;    F --&gt; G[拣货包装]&#10;    G --&gt; H[承运商交接]&#10;    H --&gt; I[配送追踪]&#10;    I --&gt; J[签收确认]\">graph LR\n    A[订单接收] --&gt; B[订单校验]\n    B --&gt; C[库存分配]\n    C --&gt; D[仓库选择]\n    D --&gt; E[拆单/合单]\n    E --&gt; F[波次规划]\n    F --&gt; G[拣货包装]\n    G --&gt; H[承运商交接]\n    H --&gt; I[配送追踪]\n    I --&gt; J[签收确认]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>履约模式</th>\n<th>时效承诺</th>\n<th>库存位置</th>\n<th>成本水平</th>\n<th>适用品类</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>即时履约</td>\n<td>30-60分钟</td>\n<td>前置仓/门店</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>生鲜、药品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当日达</td>\n<td>4-12小时</td>\n<td>城市仓</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>日百、快消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次日达</td>\n<td>12-24小时</td>\n<td>区域仓</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>标品主力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准配送</td>\n<td>2-5天</td>\n<td>中心仓</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>长尾、低频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预约配送</td>\n<td>用户指定</td>\n<td>任意仓</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大件、个性化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"订单路由与仓库选择\">订单路由与仓库选择</h2><p>订单路由（Order Routing）决定了每笔订单由哪个仓库履约。最简单的规则是&quot;最近仓库发货&quot;，但实际场景远比这复杂——最近仓库可能缺货、产能已满或正处于大促高峰。</p>\n<p>智能订单路由引擎综合考虑多个因素：库存可用性（目标 SKU 是否有货）、配送时效（能否满足承诺的时效）、物流成本（运费差异）、仓库负载（当前产能利用率）、拆单成本（尽量避免一个订单从多个仓库发货）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface OrderRoutingEngine {&#10;  factors: {&#10;    inventoryAvailability: { weight: 0.3 };&#10;    deliverySpeed: { weight: 0.25 };&#10;    shippingCost: { weight: 0.2 };&#10;    warehouseLoad: { weight: 0.15 };&#10;    splitOrderPenalty: { weight: 0.1 };&#10;  };&#10;  constraints: {&#10;    maxSplitShipments: number;&#10;    maxDeliveryDays: number;&#10;    excludeWarehouses: string[];&#10;    preferredCarriers: string[];&#10;  };&#10;  optimization: {&#10;    objective: &#39;minimize_cost&#39; | &#39;minimize_time&#39; | &#39;balanced&#39;;&#10;    algorithm: &#39;greedy&#39; | &#39;linear_programming&#39; | &#39;genetic&#39;;&#10;    batchSize: number;&#10;    timeoutMs: number;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface RoutingDecision {&#10;  orderId: string;&#10;  shipments: {&#10;    warehouseId: string;&#10;    items: { sku: string; quantity: number }[];&#10;    carrier: string;&#10;    estimatedCost: number;&#10;    estimatedDelivery: string;&#10;  }[];&#10;  totalCost: number;&#10;  isSplitOrder: boolean;&#10;  routingReason: string;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderRoutingEngine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  factors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    inventoryAvailability</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    deliverySpeed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    shippingCost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    warehouseLoad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    splitOrderPenalty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  constraints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxSplitShipments</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxDeliveryDays</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    excludeWarehouses</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    preferredCarriers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  optimization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    objective</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'minimize_cost'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'minimize_time'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'balanced'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    algorithm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'greedy'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'linear_programming'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'genetic'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    batchSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    timeoutMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RoutingDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  shipments</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    warehouseId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">quantity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    carrier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    estimatedCost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    estimatedDelivery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  totalCost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  isSplitOrder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  routingReason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路由策略</th>\n<th>优化目标</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最近仓库</td>\n<td>时效</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>单仓/简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最低成本</td>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多仓/标品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载均衡</td>\n<td>产能</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大促峰值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多目标优化</td>\n<td>综合</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>大型平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"拆单与合单\">拆单与合单</h2><p>拆单（Order Splitting）发生在一个订单的商品分布在不同仓库时，需要拆分为多个子订单分别履约。合单（Order Merging）则是将同一用户在短时间内下的多个订单合并为一个包裹发出，节省物流成本并提升用户体验。</p>\n<p>拆单的决策逻辑：如果订单中的所有 SKU 在同一个仓库都有库存，则不拆单；如果部分 SKU 在不同仓库，评估拆单成本（多次配送费用）vs 跨仓调拨成本（库存转移时间和费用），选择总成本更低的方案。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface OrderSplitMergeEngine {&#10;  splitPolicy: {&#10;    allowSpl